        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S44R5-SEC, 4\" x 4\" x 5/8\" Radius Residential Durable Steel Hinge with Security Stud</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, steel pin. Utilizes zig-zag screw hole pattern for use with wood doors. These extra security door hinges have locking tabs that join the 2 hinge leaves together when door is closed. This holds a closed door in place even if the door hinges are tampered with (if hinge pins are removed or cut).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S44R53-SEC-Specifications.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"257\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S44R5-SEC Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch x 5/8 Radius Residential Steel Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 5/8\" Radius</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Zig-Zag Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Security Stud</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-s44R53-SEC-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262384\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S44R5-SEC Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
