                "description": "4 x 4 x 5/8 Radius Residential Steel Hinges with Security Stud, Pair, Deltana S44R5-SEC. Fitted with a high grade, removable, steel pin. Utilizes zig-zag screw hole pattern for use with wood doors. These extra security door hinges have locking tabs that join the 2 hinge leaves together when door is closed. This holds a closed door in place even if the door hinges are tampered with (if hinge pins are removed or cut).",
